.TH EGGHEAD-INIT 1 "April 2026" "egghead 0.1.0" "Egghead Manual"
.SH NAME
egghead-init \- first-run setup wizard
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B egghead init
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR PATH ]
.RB [ \-\-dry\-run ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Walks through initial Egghead setup: records directory location, LLM
provider configuration (API key entry and verification), and built-in
agent model selection. Saves results to
.IR ~/.config/egghead/config.yml .
.PP
Safe to re-run. Existing values are shown as defaults and preserved
unless changed.
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fIPATH\fR
Save config to a custom path instead of the default.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Show what would be written without saving anything.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B EGGHEAD_CONFIG
Override the config file path (same as \-\-config).
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
egghead init
egghead init \-\-config ~/projects/my\-kb/egghead.yml
egghead init \-\-dry\-run
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR egghead-config (1),
.BR egghead-llm (1),
.BR egghead-doctor (1),
.BR egghead (1)
